     "solution": "直线上取点 $P_0(1,1,1)$、方向 $\\vec s=(1,2,3)$。$\\overrightarrow{P_0P}=(0,1,2)$。叉积 $\\overrightarrow{P_0P}\\times\\vec s=(1\\cdot 3-2\\cdot 2,\\ 2\\cdot 1-0\\cdot 3,\\ 0\\cdot 2-1\\cdot 1)=(-1,2,-1)$，模 $\\sqrt{6}$；$|\\vec s|=\\sqrt{14}$。距离 $d=\\dfrac{\\sqrt6}{\\sqrt{14}}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3}{7}}$。垂足参数 $t^*=\\dfrac{\\overrightarrow{P_0P}\\cdot\\vec s}{|\\vec s|^2}=\\dfrac{0+2+6}{14}=\\dfrac{4}{7}$，垂足 $Q=\\left(1+\\dfrac{4}{7},1+\\dfrac{8}{7},1+\\dfrac{12}{7}\\right)=\\left(\\dfrac{11}{7},\\dfrac{15}{7},\\dfrac{19}{7}\\right)$。",
